Certification a gold star
=========================

Version 0.9.7 of this package was accepted for publication in volume 9 (see
https://msp.org/jsag/2019/9-1/ ) of The Journal of Software for Algebra and
Geometry (see https://msp.org/jsag/ ) on 27 September 2018, in the article
Matroids: a Macaulay2 package (see https://msp.org/jsag/2019/9-1/p03.xhtml )
(DOI: 10.2140/jsag.2019.9.19 (see https://doi.org/10.2140/jsag.2019.9.19 )).
That version can be obtained from the journal (see
https://msp.org/jsag/2019/9-1/jsag-v9-n1-x03-Matroids.m2 ).

