    an elementary quotient of another matroid
  * *note isLinearSubclass: isLinearSubclass, -- whether a list of hyperplanes
    of a matroid is a linear subclass
  * *note isModularCut: isModularCut, -- whether a list of flats of a matroid
    is a modular cut
