    computes an isomorphism between isomorphic matroids
  * *note quickIsomorphismTest: quickIsomorphismTest, -- quick checks for
    isomorphism between matroids
  * *note areIsomorphic(Matroid,Matroid): areIsomorphic_lpMatroid_cmMatroid_rp,
    -- whether two matroids are isomorphic

