getRepresentation -- retrieves stored representation
****************************************************

  * Usage: 
        getRepresentation M
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note matroid: Matroid,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note thing: (Macaulay2Doc)Thing,, a representation of M (either a
        matrix or a graph)

Description
===========

For a matroid created from a matrix, this function provides a user-friendly way
to access the original matrix. Similarly, for a matroid created from a (simple)
graph, this function returns the graph used to create the matroid.

Note that some constructions applied to a matroid M (such as taking dual, or
minors) will automatically compute an induced representation (if a
representation of M exists), which can be viewed with this function.



+----------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = random(QQ^3,QQ^5)              |
|                                        |
|o1 = | 9/2 7/4  7/10 3/7 5/4  |         |
|     | 9/4 7/9  7/3  6/7 2/9  |         |
|     | 3/4 7/10 7    6   3/10 |         |
|                                        |
|              3       5                 |
|o1 : Matrix QQ  <-- QQ                  |
+----------------------------------------+
|i2 : M = matroid A                      |
|                                        |
|o2 = a "matroid" of rank 3 on 5 elements|
|                                        |
|o2 : Matroid                            |
+----------------------------------------+
|i3 : A == getRepresentation M           |
|                                        |
|o3 = true                               |
+----------------------------------------+
|i4 : K4 = completeGraph 4               |
|                                        |
|o4 = Graph{0 => {1, 2, 3}}              |
|           1 => {0, 2, 3}               |
|           2 => {0, 1, 3}               |
|           3 => {0, 1, 2}               |
|                                        |
|o4 : Graph                              |
+----------------------------------------+
|i5 : M4 = matroid K4                    |
|                                        |
|o5 = a "matroid" of rank 3 on 6 elements|
|                                        |
|o5 : Matroid                            |
+----------------------------------------+
|i6 : getRepresentation M4 === K4        |
|                                        |
|o6 = true                               |
+----------------------------------------+
|i7 : N = M / set{0}                     |
|                                        |
|o7 = a "matroid" of rank 2 on 4 elements|
|                                        |
|o7 : Matroid                            |
+----------------------------------------+
|i8 : getRepresentation N                |
|                                        |
|o8 = | 196/3083  111671/92490 1 0 |     |
|     | 1057/3083 -9240/3083   0 1 |     |
|                                        |
|              2       4                 |
|o8 : Matrix QQ  <-- QQ                  |
+----------------------------------------+

