isElementaryQuotient -- whether a matroid is an elementary quotient of another matroid
**************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        isElementaryQuotient(M, N)
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note matroid: Matroid,
      * N, a *note matroid: Matroid,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, whether the first
        matroid is an elementary quotient of the second

Description
===========

This function is provided by the package *note Matroids: Top,.

An elementary quotient of a matroid N is a quotient M whose rank is the rank of
N minus one.  Elementary quotients are completely determined by the modular cut
of flats in M (which are also flats of N) whose rank in M is one less than
their rank in N. Examples of elementary quotients of N are its principal
truncations with respect to a given flat F.

+-----------------------------------------+
|i1 : N = matroid completeGraph 5         |
|                                         |
|o1 = a "matroid" of rank 4 on 10 elements|
|                                         |
|o1 : Matroid                             |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = set {0,1,4};                    |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i3 : TFN = truncate(F, N)                |
|                                         |
|o3 = a "matroid" of rank 3 on 10 elements|
|                                         |
|o3 : Matroid                             |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i4 : isElementaryQuotient(TFN, N)        |
|                                         |
|o4 = true                                |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i5 : T2N = truncate(2, N)                |
|                                         |
|o5 = a "matroid" of rank 2 on 10 elements|
|                                         |
|o5 : Matroid                             |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i6 : isElementaryQuotient(T2N, N)        |
|                                         |
|o6 = false                               |
+-----------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note elementaryQuotient: elementaryQuotient, -- associated to a modular
    cut or linear subclass
  * *note isModularCut: isModularCut, -- whether a list of flats of a matroid
    is a modular cut
  * *note isQuotient: isQuotient, -- whether a matroid is a quotient of another
    matroid
  * *note modularCut: modularCut, -- associated to an elementary quotient or
    linear subclass
  * *note truncate(Set,Matroid): truncate_lpSet_cmMatroid_rp, -- the truncation
    of a matroid with respect to a flat

