Matroid -- the class of all matroids
************************************

Description
===========

To see how to specify a matroid, see *note matroid: matroid,.

In this package, the ground set of the matroid is always (internally) assumed
to be a set of the form $\{0, ..., n-1\}$. This means that although the actual
elements of the ground set can be arbitrary, all subsets of the ground set are
specified by their indices, i.e. as a subset of $\{0, ..., n-1\}$ (this
includes bases, circuits, flats, loops, etc.).

For convenience, the user can specify a subset of the ground set either by
indices (which are integers between 0 and n-1), or as actual elements. If
indices are used, they should be given as a *note Set: (Macaulay2Doc)Set,, and
if elements are used, they should be given as a *note List:
(Macaulay2Doc)List,.

One can use the function *note indicesOf: indicesOf, to convert elements of the
ground set to their indices. Conversely, use *note subscripts: Matroid _us
List, to obtain the elements from their indices.

A recommended way to circumvent this distinction between indices and elements
is to make the elements of M equal to integers from 0 to n-1, in which case an
element is equal to its index in M.groundSet.

For more on this package-wide convention, see *note groundSet: groundSet,.



+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : U24 = uniformMatroid(2, 4)                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = a "matroid" of rank 2 on 4 elements                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : Matroid                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : U24 == dual U24                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : ideal U24                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = monomialIdeal (x x x , x x x , x x x , x x x )                          |
|                     0 1 2   0 1 3   0 2 3   1 2 3                           |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : MonomialIdeal of QQ[x ..x ]                                             |
|                          0   3                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : peek U24                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = Matroid{bases => {set {0, 1}, set {0, 2}, set {1, 2}, set {0, 3}, set   |
|             cache => CacheTable{...3...}                                    |
|             groundSet => set {0, 1, 2, 3}                                   |
|             rank => 2                                                       |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{1, 3}, set {2, 3}}}                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : tuttePolynomial U24                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|      2    2                                                                 |
|o5 = x  + y  + 2x + 2y                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : ZZ[x, y]                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : N = U24 / {0}                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = a "matroid" of rank 1 on 3 elements                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : Matroid                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : areIsomorphic(N, uniformMatroid(1, 3))                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+



Many computations performed in this package are cached in order to speed up
subsequent calculations (as well as avoiding redundancy). These include the
*note circuits: circuits,, *note flats: flats,, *note ideal:
ideal_lpMatroid_rp,, *note rank function: rank_lpMatroid_cmSet_rp,, and *note
Tutte polynomial: tuttePolynomial_lpMatroid_rp, of a matroid, and are stored in
the *note CacheTable: (Macaulay2Doc)CacheTable, of the matroid. Since the cache
is a *note MutableHashTable: (Macaulay2Doc)MutableHashTable,, the user can also
manually cache data (e.g. if it has been computed in a previous session), which
can greatly speed up computation.



+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : R10 = specificMatroid "R10"                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = a "matroid" of rank 5 on 10 elements                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : Matroid                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : keys R10.cache                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = {groundSet, rankFunction, storedRepresentation}                         |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : time isWellDefined R10                                                 |
| -- used 0.0597049s (cpu); 0.0597047s (thread); 0s (gc)                      |
|                                                                             |
|o10 = true                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : time fVector R10                                                       |
| -- used 0.052985s (cpu); 0.0529872s (thread); 0s (gc)                       |
|                                                                             |
|o11 = HashTable{0 => 1 }                                                     |
|                1 => 10                                                      |
|                2 => 45                                                      |
|                3 => 75                                                      |
|                4 => 30                                                      |
|                5 => 1                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o11 : HashTable                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : keys R10.cache                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o12 = {hyperplanes, flatsRelationsTable, rankFunction, ideal, ranks, flats,  |
|      -----------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      groundSet, dual, storedRepresentation}                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o12 : List                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : time fVector R10                                                       |
| -- used 0.000264934s (cpu); 0.000264703s (thread); 0s (gc)                  |
|                                                                             |
|o13 = HashTable{0 => 1 }                                                     |
