rank(Matroid) -- rank of a matroid
**********************************

  * Function: *note rank: (Macaulay2Doc)rank,
  * Usage: 
        rank M
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note matroid: Matroid,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 

Description
===========

The rank of a matroid is the common size of a(ny) basis of M. This is a basic
numerical invariant of a matroid.



+-----------------------------------------+
|i1 : M = matroid({a,b,c,d},{{a,b},{a,c}})|
|                                         |
|o1 = a "matroid" of rank 2 on 4 elements |
|                                         |
|o1 : Matroid                             |
