tutteEvaluate -- evaluate Tutte polynomial
******************************************

  * Usage: 
        tutteEvaluate(M, a, b)
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note matroid: Matroid,, 
      * a, a *note thing: (Macaulay2Doc)Thing,, 
      * b, a *note thing: (Macaulay2Doc)Thing,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note thing: (Macaulay2Doc)Thing,, the evaluation of the Tutte
        polynomial of M at (a, b)

Description
===========

Provides a user-friendly method to evaluate the Tutte polynomial at given
values (i.e. calls *note substitute: (Macaulay2Doc)substitute, with the correct
variables in the ring of the Tutte polynomial). For example, if M has Tutte
polynomial T, then T(1,1) is the number of bases of M.



+----------------------------------------+
|i1 : M = uniformMatroid(2, 4)           |
|                                        |
|o1 = a "matroid" of rank 2 on 4 elements|
|                                        |
|o1 : Matroid                            |
+----------------------------------------+
|i2 : tutteEvaluate(M, 1, 1)             |
|                                        |
|o2 = 6                                  |
+----------------------------------------+



If M = M(G) is the graphic matroid of a graph G, then T(2, 1) counts the number
of spanning forests of G, and T(2, 0) counts the number of acyclic orientations
of G.



+-----------------------------------------+
|i3 : M = matroid completeGraph 5         |
|                                         |
|o3 = a "matroid" of rank 4 on 10 elements|
|                                         |
|o3 : Matroid                             |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i4 : tutteEvaluate(M, 2, 1)              |
|                                         |
|o4 = 291                                 |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i5 : tutteEvaluate(M, 2, 0)              |
|                                         |
|o5 = 120                                 |
+-----------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note tuttePolynomial(Matroid): tuttePolynomial_lpMatroid_rp, -- Tutte
    polynomial of a matroid

