tuttePolynomial(Matroid) -- Tutte polynomial of a matroid
*********************************************************

  * Function: *note tuttePolynomial: (Posets)tuttePolynomial,
  * Usage: 
        tuttePolynomial M
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note matroid: Matroid,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, the Tutte polynomial
        of M

Description
===========

The Tutte polynomial is an invariant of a matroid that is universal with
respect to satisfying a deletion-contraction recurrence. Indeed, one way to
define the Tutte polynomial of a matroid is: if $M$ is a matroid consisting of
$a$ loops and $b$ coloops, then $T_M(x, y) = x^ay^b$, and if $e \in M$ is
neither a loop nor a coloop, then $T_M(x, y) := T_{M \backslash e}(x, y) +
T_{M/e}(x, y)$, where M\e is the *note deletion: deletion, of M with respect to
$\{e\}$, and M/e is the *note contraction: contraction, of M with respect to
$\{e\}$. Many invariants of a matroid can be determined by substituting values
into its Tutte polynomial - cf. *note tutteEvaluate: tutteEvaluate,.



+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : tuttePolynomial matroid completeGraph 4                   |
|                                                               |
|      3    3     2            2                                |
|o1 = x  + y  + 3x  + 4x*y + 3y  + 2x + 2y                      |
|                                                               |
|o1 : ZZ[x, y]                                                  |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : tuttePolynomial specificMatroid "nonpappus"               |
|                                                               |
|      6     5     4    3      3     2             2            |
|o2 = y  + 3y  + 6y  + x  + 10y  + 6x  + 8x*y + 15y  + 13x + 13y|
|                                                               |
|o2 : ZZ[x, y]                                                  |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note tutteEvaluate: tutteEvaluate, -- evaluate Tutte polynomial
  * *note characteristicPolynomial(Matroid):
    characteristicPolynomial_lpMatroid_rp, -- computes characteristic
    polynomial of a matroid
  * *note chromaticPolynomial: chromaticPolynomial, -- computes chromatic
    polynomial of a graph
  * *note deletion: deletion, -- deletion of subset of matroid
  * *note contraction: contraction, -- contraction of subset of matroid

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note tuttePolynomial(Matroid): tuttePolynomial_lpMatroid_rp, -- Tutte
    polynomial of a matroid
  * "tuttePolynomial(Matroid,Ring)"
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

